  "disposition": "With the command-split lift the one-port backend meets setup at all three extracted corners under the clock-gating overlay: slow +0.602 ns with no violating endpoint (oneport-sampled-01, same contract without the split: -0.187 ns, 9 endpoints; combined-03, the same-overlay control: -2.251 ns, 40). Hold met, zero routing violations after 13 passes (51 before), Magic DRC, LVS and antenna clean, flow exit 0. As the structural model and Storage/DataPort.lean state, the data port now reaches only loader logic (+4.383 ns, to the loader_rejected output). The register family moved from -0.053 to +1.100 ns although its structural depth changed by one level; that is more than the 0.6 ns spread seen between equivalent RTLs, and its cause is not isolated. Retain as the leading experimental variant; one run, no promotion, frequency or fit claim.",
